      "date": "Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:52:26 GMT",
      "image": "https://horseedmedia.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Sheekh-Maxamuud.webp",
      "content": "Madaxweyne Deni oo culimada ka codsaday inay xal u raadiyaan khilaafka Somalia. | Horseed Media Skip to content Search Home Somalia News Puntland News World News in English Featured More.. Dowladda Federaalka Galmudug Hiiraan News Jubaland News Koonfur Galbeed SSC Somaliland Follow us Search Somali News Madaxweyne Deni oo culimada ka codsaday inay xal u raadiyaan khilaafka Somalia. Posted by: Horseed Staff Qaar kamid ah culimaa’udiinka reer Puntland ayaa si adag uga hadlay xaaladda Siyaasadeed ee Soomaaliya, khilaafyada… 25 October, 2026 Share Tweet Qaar kamid ah culimaa’udiinka reer Puntland ayaa si adag uga hadlay xaaladda Siyaasadeed ee Soomaaliya, khilaafyada ka dhashay arrimaha dastuurka, doorashooyinka iyo is-haysiga siyaasiyiinta ku loolamaya kursiga Madaxtinimada ee ugu sarreeya Soomaaliya. Sheekh Maxamuud Xaaji Yuusuf oo kamid ah culimaa’udiinka Puntland ee ku sugan Garoowe ayaa sheegay inay la kulmeen Madaxweynaha Puntland Siciid Cabdullaahi Deni, uuna u ogolaaday in talada culimada lagu wareejiyo, isagoo ugu yeeray Madaxda Dowladda federalka ah ee Somalia inay talada dhulka dhigaan. “Dowladda Puntland waxaan la kulanay Madaxweynaha anagoo dhawr culimo ah wuxuu yiri “culimooy gala arrinta xal keena” , ogolaansho ayaan ka haysanaa waa caddaynayaa maanta xilku wuxuu saaran yahay dowladda Xamar inay talada dhulka dhigaan”, Ayuu yiri Sheekh Maxamuud Xaaji Yuusuf. Dhanka kalena, Sheekh Maxamuud Xaaji Yuusuf ayaa si adag uga hadlay cawaaqib xumida ka dhalankarta xukunka oo laysku dhejiyo iyo haddii aysan talada dhulka dhigin Madaxda dowladda federalka ah ee Soomaaliya isagoo ka codsaday Madaxweynaha Soomaaliya inuu wadahadalka ogolaado, ayna arrinta shareecada Islaamka u wareejiyaan, isagoo xusay in beesha caalamka iyo danleeyda siyaasadda caalamku aysan dan u hayn dhammaan dhinacyada Soomaalida. “Warka lalee yahay haddaan dhulka la dhigimaayo, haddii aan dhulka la dhigin talada meel daran ayey ka dhacaysaa waxaan u gudbinaynaa Madaxweynaha iyo dowladdiisa walaalayaalow talada dhulka dhiga, hay’adahaan beesha 6aad iyo waxaad aad daba-joogtaan & dowladaha dhegta wax idinku sheegaya wallaahi ayeysan waxba idin tarayn ee arrinta dhulka hala-dhigo oo haloo ogolaado diinta iyo shareecada Islaamka”, Ayuu yiri Markale Sheekh Maxamuud Xaaji Yuusuf. Related Posts Wafdi Sare oo Turki ah oo Booqasho ku Yimid Soomaaliya 1 min read Cabdi Xaashi & guddoomiye Jaamac oo kulan ku yeeshay Muqdisho. 1 min read Madaxweyne Deni oo ku dhawaaqay go’aamo ku aaddan dowladnimada Somalia. 2 min read Maxaa looga hadlay kulankii Madaxweyne Xasan Sheekh & Islaan Ciise. 1 min read Back to top Horseed Media About Profile Contact us Privacy Policy Terms and Conditions Category Wararka Soomaaliya Puntland News News Somalia Dowladda Federaalka World News ©2026 Horseed Media Ltd",
      "summary": "Madaxweyne Siciid Cabdullaahi Deni ayaa ka codsaday culimada Puntland inay ka qeybqaataan xalinta khilaafaadka siyaasadeed ee Soomaaliya, gaar ahaan arrimaha dastuurka, doorashooyinka, iyo tartanka siyaasiyiinta. Sheekh Maxamuud Xaaji Yuusuf, oo ka mid ah culimada, ayaa sheegay in madaxweynaha uu ogolaaday in talada culimada la siiyo, isagoo ku baaqay in madaxda dowladda Federaalka ay talada dhulka dhigaan. Sheekh Maxamuud ayaa sidoo kale ka digay cawaaqib xumida ka dhalan karta haddii aan la xalin khilaafaadka, wuxuuna ku booriyay madaxweynaha Soomaaliya inuu ogolaado wadahadal, si arrimaha la xiriira shareecada Islaamka loo xalliyo. Wuxuu muujiyay in beesha caalamka aysan dan ka lahayn dhammaan dhinacyada Soomaalida, isagoo ku adkeeyay in talada la dhigo si loo helo xal waara. Deni iyo culimada ayaa ka wada hadlaya sidii loo xalin lahaa khilaafaadka jira.",
      "page_url": "https://aynnews.net/news/madaxweyne-deni-oo-culimada-ka-codsaday-inay-xal-u-raadiyaan-2206e609bb.html"
    }
